{"version":1,"title":"标签：嚴月 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"navbar top\"><div class=\"navbar-blur\"><div class=\"navbar-container\"><nav class=\"post\"><a href=\"/\">近期发布</a><a href=\"/categories/\">分类</a><a class=\"active\" href=\"/tags/\">标签：嚴月</a><a href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><a href=\"/archives/\">归档</a><a href=\"/recent/\">BAKER</a></nav></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"post-list post\"><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/aaca0c6e/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[楠竹蓮花集]2025 的 A - Z</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>年终总结。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-31T12:39:26.000Z\">2025-12-31</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\" style=\"--text-p2:#FFDD88;--theme-block:#FFDD8820\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>楠竹蓮花集</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/585cfa20/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">†[BUAA 基礎物理學]基础物理学 B II 概要</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北航基础物理学 B (II) 概要。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-21T08:09:13.000Z\">2025-12-21</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 基礎物理學</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/52a88c87/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO]CO 理论概要</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北航计算机组成理论概要。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-16T12:50:27.000Z\">2025-12-16</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/1a21b5b/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[楠竹蓮花集]十二月八日</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>二〇二五年十二月八日是个重大的日子。这一天结束了我的计组实验，同时让我第一次意识到我已经是个成年人了。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-09T04:29:46.000Z\">2025-12-09</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\" style=\"--text-p2:#FFDD88;--theme-block:#FFDD8820\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>楠竹蓮花集</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/444343b2/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO Finale] 2025 北航计算机组成实验总结</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>买了点烤串，买了一杯 RIO 回寝室放松一下。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-08T15:26:29.000Z\">2025-12-08</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/28be479a/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P7]Verilog 设计 MIPS 微系统</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>It's time to leave all behind.</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-12-08T14:48:21.000Z\">2025-12-08</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/905092e9/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P6]Verilog 设计五级流水线 CPU-2</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>我去，这才是我最接近 AK 的一次呃呃……</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\